== Other ==
* The {{tf|Spun}} transformation increases damage by 2.
* The {{tf|Conjoined}} transformation decreases damage by 0.3.
* {{dlc|a}} In co-op, [[Rage Baby]], [[Revenge Baby]], and [[Belial Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase damage. [[Dark Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase all stats, including damage. [[Buddy Baby]] will occasionally briefly grant the {{i|Guillotine}} effect, which increases damage. [[Whore Baby]] will occasionally briefly grant the {{i|Whore of Babylon}} effect, which increases damage.
* {{dlc|r}} The [[Pills#Horse Pills|horse]] [[Power Pill!]] activates the {{p|Huge Growth|n}} effect for the current room, which grants +7 flat damage.
* {{dlc|r}} Standing next to a {{e|White Poop|n}} or a [[Familiar#Dips|white dip]] grants a x1.2 damage multiplier.
* {{dlc|r}} Standing on a brown creep produced by {{c|Tainted ???}} or {{i|IBS|n}} grants +1 damage.
* {{dlc|r}} {{c|Lazarus Risen}} + {{i|Birthright|n}}: Grants +7.2 damage which fades away quickly.

